                        <div id="page-title">
                            CSS Theme Preparation Tool
                        </div>
                    

                    
                        <div id="breadcrumbs">
                            <a href="/guide-hub">Guide Hub</a> &raquo; CSS Theme Preparation Tool
                        </div>
                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        






<div class="unmargined" style="margin: 0 auto 20px; background-color: #b7a; border: solid 1px #b7a; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.8), inset 0 10px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6), inset 0 -15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2); text-align: center; width: 500px;">
<div class="unmargined" style="margin: 20px 0; font-size: 300%; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.5);">
<p>GO DOWN THE <span class="ruby">RABBIT HOLE<span class="rt">C S S</span></span>&#8230;</p>
</div>
<div class="unmargined" style="margin: 20px 0; color: #fff;">
<p>This thing with which you can make simple CSS Theme. If you want to learn more wikidot magic, check out following pages:<br /></p>
<div style="text-align: left;">
<ul>
<li><a href="/advanced-formatting-and-you">Advanced Formatting and You</a><br />
&#8212; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(318209); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=318209&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1600488110" alt="DrMagnus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=318209)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(318209); return false;">DrMagnus</a></span></li>
<li><a href="/scp-style-resource">SCP Style Resource</a><br />
